{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018071539200-1018_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261018072400\"/><p>警車到場善後。</p><p>一輛汽車上周六（17日）下午3時許衝入美國堪薩斯州威奇托市一個正進行足球比賽的場地，造成兩人死亡、多人受傷。警方正對事件進行調查。</p><p>事件發生在當地的斯特賴克體育綜合中心，死者包括一名兒童和一名成年人。警方發言人在社交媒體上證實，肇事司機已被控制。該司機不會對公眾構成持續威脅。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:18:49.550625+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T23:15:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:37:53.186490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:51.290459+00:00","content_hash":"08a8f0542582a0a35b8949ffd0d7448dda07e81110a996ef941b9ef2315b2b33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}